# Court of Garenbrig's upkeep trigger divides its two +1/+1 counters between Bot1's Guerrilla Gorilla and Bot2's Cryptfen
# Elves (CR 601.2d), chosen together with the targets by a Divide line. Bot1 is the monarch, so the Court then doubles
# the counters on each creature Bot1 controls: the Gorilla's one becomes two, and the Elves keeps its one.

